Z||000004||Oreif||02-25-2001||11:25 AM||||Haze, If you really want to do a convertable, Email coyote (Scott). He has a 1/2 finished 84 that he made into a convertable. He was going to put a V-8 into it but I think the V-8 is going into the GT. Scott may be willing to sell it if you really want to put the work into it. It needs the body work and the top. The interior has Mr Mikes leather seats. It's red outside and tan interior. It's an 84 SE with a 4-cyl/4-speed. The supports for the frame are all done the way Bob does it so there is no external braces blocking the gas tank.||||reg||1
